# promise: #604
# todoist:// typed in ⌘T and sent with Return opened nothing. Another app's address typed in the
# command bar now opens that app with no tab (AppLinks.typed, AppLinksTests); this checks Return goes
# through it without launching an app here: an app address no app on this Mac opens is searched for,
# as Chrome does, and a scheme Cra never hands to macOS (afp:) opens nothing.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false, "searchEngine": "duckduckgo"}
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=start
wait 2

cra://commandbar?query=cranoapp604://inbox
wait 1
cra://debug?key=%0D,36,0
wait 2
expect-log command bar: no app opens cranoapp604:, searched
cra://debug?browserWindows=noapp
expect-log Cra browser windows noapp: .*open=https://duckduckgo\.com/\?q=cranoapp604

cra://commandbar?query=afp://server/share
wait 1
cra://debug?key=%0D,36,0
wait 2
expect-log command bar can't open afp: \(refused\)
cra://debug?browserWindows=refused
expect-log Cra browser windows refused: .*open=https://duckduckgo\.com/\?q=cranoapp604
